Id	Sheet	Group	Artefact	Rule
M1	Content	Integrations	OTLP file	JSON Lines: UTF-8, one JSON value per line, LF between lines
M1	Content	Integrations	OTLP file	each line in OTLP JSON encoding
M1	Content	Integrations	OTLP file	TracesData, MetricsData or LogsData; one kind of data per file
M1	Content	Integrations	GenAI structured attributes	structured on events; on spans structured, or a JSON string where structure is not supported
M2	Content	Integrations	OTLP file	lines in no guaranteed order
M3	Content	Integrations	OTLP JSON	a receiver ignores fields with unknown names
M4	Content	Integrations	OTLP JSON	trace and span ids are hex strings
M4	Content	Integrations	OTLP JSON	hex ids are case-insensitive
M5	Content	Integrations	GenAI structured attributes	structured on events; on spans structured, or a JSON string where structure is not supported
M5	Content	Integrations	GenAI system instructions	the attribute gen_ai.system_instructions
